chapter.v:
This calls 


for wisdom:, 


let the one who has understanding calculate the number of the beast, for it is the number of a man, and his number is 666.(6) Footnotes (1) 13:6 Or *tabernacle* (2) 13:7 Some manuscripts omit this sentence (3) 13:12 Or *on its behalf* (4) 13:14 Or *on behalf of* (5) 13:16 For the contextual rendering of the Greek word *doulos*, see Preface (6) 13:18 Some manuscripts *616* (ESV)
